category: Text
requires: cygwin libbrotlidec1 libbz2_1 libbzip3_1 libgcc1 liblz4_1 liblzma5 libpcre2_8_0 libstdc++6 libzstd1 zlib0
sdesc: "Ultra fast grep with query UI, fuzzy search, archive search, and more"
ldesc: "An ultra fast, user-friendly, compatible grep. Ugrep combines the best features
of other grep, adds new features, and searches fast. Includes a TUI and adds
Google-like search, fuzzy search, hexdumps, searches nested archives (zip, 7z,
tar, pax, cpio), compressed files (gz, Z, bz2, lzma, xz, lz4, zstd, brotli),
pdfs, docs, and more"

